nd of Tindalos\"</strong>, slipping through the angles of reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>\"Dark Wizard\"</strong>, deep within the mists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather the <strong>[Eldritch Power]</strong> they demand within a limited number of turns \u2014 or your cult will be devoured by the Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/6f4784ed38080a56661b1287e5de9b0e.poster.avif?t=1784174759\" width=\"480\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/6f4784ed38080a56661b1287e5de9b0e.webm?t=1784174759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/6f4784ed38080a56661b1287e5de9b0e.mp4?t=1784174759\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/d72a8ea3c18e3a548cdbb4dec1fbba79.avif?t=1784174759\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your path. Wander between shops, treasures, and sudden encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect rare relics and strengthen your deck across trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/e1629db72b39e6a60182f2ff15a9083f.poster.avif?t=1784174759\" width=\"480\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/e1629db72b39e6a60182f2ff15a9083f.webm?t=1784174759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/e1629db72b39e6a60182f2ff15a9083f.mp4?t=1784174759\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/677b0dfff6c785c0548ae8ac28c708d0.avif?t=1784174759\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run is a new experiment in belief. Chase the wildest combinations of followers and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Watch mortals and gods alike kneel before the <strong>[Eldritch Power]</strong> chain you meticulously designed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u3000</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A dark turn-based strategy card game. Place followers and buildings across the board, let [Faith] and [Devotion] resonate into bursts of [Eldritch Power], and build your cult empire on the edge of devotion and madness.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/0b1e7c7c0ddc4d23aa473a8e7c6939a62fc233b2/header.jpg?t=1784174759", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Deckbuilding", "Roguelike", "Card Game", "Female Protagonist", "Turn-Based Strategy"], "developers": "Kibi Games, Poly Poly Games", "publishers": "Kibi Games, Poly Poly Games", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3539480", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "4 May 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bsw5nznFCCI", "first_seen": 1777845600.0, "review_rank": 711}